# Tree version of physics_converted.scn (dynamics grammar plan, G3): the
# panel refuses only what a law refuses. Still and Anneal are kinematic and
# take an overlay converted, so no overlay is greyed for them; Density takes
# Hub room, Centre and Tide converted and greys the other five (F73,
# F81), so
# Centre stays ticked.
assert snap ready == true
click role:combobox Physics law
settle 1
click role:option Anneal
settle 1
click role:checkbox Centre
settle 1
assert snap panel-overlays == gravity-locus
assert snap disabled-overlays == 0
click role:combobox Physics law
settle 1
click role:option Still
settle 1
assert snap disabled-overlays == 0
click role:button Apply physics
settle 1
assert snap physics-law == still.default
assert snap physics-overlays == gravity-locus
assert text Physics set to Still
click role:combobox Physics law
settle 1
click role:option Density
settle 1
assert snap disabled-overlays == 5
assert snap panel-overlays == gravity-locus
assert text Density takes only Hub room, Centre and Tide
log physics converted receipt complete
